  "description": "A dependency-light POCSAG paging codec for .NET: CCIR Radiopaging Code No. 1 (ITU-R M.584-2) encode and decode, with BCH(31,21) error correction, numeric and alphanumeric pages, tone-only pages, and the DAPNET amateur-paging conventions (512 / 1200 / 2400 bd, function-bit and padding conventions). Encodes pages to baseband 2-FSK audio for an FM radio's data port and decodes audio back to pages with polarity auto-detection. Extracted from the pdn-soundmodem packet-radio modem; implemented spec-first and cross-validated against multimon-ng.",
